# Build-time only. Used by scripts/fetch-eia.ts to pull the US generating fleet,
# capacity factors, and hourly demand shapes for the transition model.
# Get a free key at https://www.eia.gov/opendata/. Copy this file to .env.local
# (gitignored) or export the variable before running `npm run data:refresh-eia`.
# NEVER commit a real key — it must never reach the client bundle.
EIA_API_KEY=
